# Module : A single python file like (math.py)
# Package : A folder containing multiple modules
# Function : A reusable block of code (print() or sqrt())
# Class : A blueprint to create object

# Think of it like
# module is a toolbox
# package is garage of multiple toolboxes
# function is a particular tool from toolbox(like hammer)
# class is like blueprint to create a particular tool

# there are 2 types of packages : built-in, ye jb hum python install krte hai tb hi bich me ho jate hai
# external packages : ye hume separately install krne pdte h using pip command
pip install name_of_package

we can also install the specific version 
pip install name_of_package==version_no.


we can also install multiple packages
pip install numpy pandas matplotlib

